OL,3,GNEWSA'No-one believed a boy like me
OL,4,Acould succeed at gymnastics'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"When I was younger, no-one believed a
OL,7,Fboy from a Bangladeshi background could
OL,8,Fmake it big in gymnastics," says
OL,9,F16-year-old Uzair Chowdhury, proudly
OL,10,Fclutching one of his shiny new gold
OL,11,Fmedals.
OL,13,F"Now that I'm competing on the world
OL,14,Fstage, people are shocked by what I've
OL,15,Fbeen able to achieve, and that makes me
OL,16,Fproud."
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
PN,37402
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1788868569
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'No-one believed a boy like me
OL,4,Acould succeed at gymnastics'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe teenager, from Luton, managed to
OL,7,Fsuccessfully defend his parallel bars
OL,8,Fand team titles he won last year, while
OL,9,Fcompeting for Team GB at the Junior
OL,10,FEuropean Championships in Croatia last
OL,11,Fmonth.
OL,13,FHe trains at Huntingdon Gymnastics Club
OL,14,Fin Cambridgeshire, which has produced
OL,15,FOlympians including Louis Smith and
OL,16,FJake Jarman - and Chowdhury hopes he
OL,17,Fcan one day put his name alongside
OL,18,Fthem.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
